"with-vqe/geometry/extracted-"
"outputs/e81f3ead-27ac-415e-a9f2-64a51d4b7aa3-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/quantum-chem-"
"with-vqe/geometry/extracted-"
"outputs/e81f3ead-27ac-415e-a9f2-64a51d4b7aa3-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that simply increasing the number of optimization steps is not likely "
"to improve the results from the simulator, since all optimizations actually "
"converged to the required tolerance in fewer than the maximum number of "
"iterations.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahwa sekadar meningkatkan jumlah langkah optimasi kemungkinan "
"besar tidak akan meningkatkan hasil dari simulator, karena semua optimasi "
"sebenarnya telah konvergen ke toleransi yang diperlukan dalam jumlah iterasi"
" yang lebih sedikit dari maksimum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The results from the real hardware are comparable, aside from a slightly "
"different range of values sampled.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hasil dari perangkat keras nyata sebanding, selain rentang nilai yang "
"sedikit berbeda yang diambil sampelnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/quantum-chem-"
"with-vqe/geometry/extracted-"
"outputs/de8f53cf-9547-4578-b6cb-20d2b5602ee0-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/quantum-chem-"
"with-vqe/geometry/extracted-"
"outputs/de8f53cf-9547-4578-b6cb-20d2b5602ee0-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In addition to expecting an H2 bond length of 0.74 Angstrom, the total "
"energy should be -1.17 Hartrees. We see that the real hardware results came "
"closer to these values than the simulator. This is likely because noise was "
"present (or simulated) in both cases, but only in the case of real hardware "
"was error mitigation employed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selain mengharapkan panjang ikatan H2 sebesar 0,74 Angstrom, energi total "
"seharusnya -1,17 Hartrees. Kita melihat bahwa hasil perangkat keras nyata "
"lebih mendekati nilai-nilai ini dibandingkan simulator. Ini kemungkinan "
"besar karena noise hadir (atau disimulasikan) di kedua kasus, tetapi hanya "
"pada kasus perangkat keras nyata mitigasi error diterapkan.\n"

